{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"277427d4e778ca3b3676367e01ba58172664f94876ac9e1ee62080c60dec0a11","ja":"配信は終わらない！","zh":"直播永不结束！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4c7fd639bc45fb22a333148b1c9fe722045bae03bd39b29a1aa386ebc9e7f48e","ja":"みんなの楽屋の過ごし方を聞いたところで、\n今日の配信は終わり…………ませんよ～！","zh":"听完了大家在休息室的度过方式，\n今天的直播到这里就结束…………才怪呢～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"17a71fd8dba097fc08051e5275dfc1ecfed338bc0cd122985b6e8fc90083a293","ja":"みんなの反応がいいから、もう少し\n続けちゃいま～すっ♪　次の企画はー……！","zh":"因为大家的反响很好，就再多\n播一会儿吧～♪　下一个企划是——……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5a225ab49d51e50ad61112ff49ee75bbfd8df55a982679c99e7acca4a3457be9","ja":"映画の撮影中にあった歩さんのいいところを\nみんなに聞いちゃお～♪","zh":"去问问大家\n在拍摄电影期间步身上都有哪些优点吧～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"2869fed2a6e6e5ed6f86a09d2d301d0542c8b0821116bc2f8e8fdd0dda2e127b","ja":"えっ、そんなこと聞くの？　面と向かって\nそんなの言われるのって、ハズいんだけど……。","zh":"诶，问这个吗？当面被\n这么问，感觉挺难为情的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ecf1d361153827ccf969510c1e707d0ecd82ae36ab654f4e42740b3bfd14da0a","ja":"でも、コメントが盛り上がってるから、\n遠慮なくいきますよー♪　じゃあ、星梨花ちゃんから！","zh":"不过，评论区气氛这么热烈，\n我就不客气地开始啦～♪　那么，从小星梨花先来！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"e97063cdd3df64266a2e86c5783e2048af6176fad1447e8e0a3e45948d88dd1d","ja":"えっ、わたしですか？　そうですね……。","zh":"诶，是我吗？这个嘛……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5a52c2555e8dd192129c1ade9b4e30e490c9120171b934535d7d80b30589f436","ja":"歩さんは、\nいつもわたしたちを気にかけてくれてます！","zh":"步小姐她，\n总是很关心我们呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2d664fb224987e4e7b400cdb6912e3cf70550ac23d34873dfc0d9b45395c9a1c","ja":"困っていると、すぐに声をかけてくれるんですよ♪","zh":"一遇到困难，就会立刻来跟我打招呼呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"db74454909755c2acfe4d8a3b55f069a0c0b6bca0c2f5b4822d35431de4f6e91","ja":"わたしも声かけてもらったことある！\nみんな～、歩さんは、すっごく優しいんだよ～！","zh":"我也被她搭过话哦！\n大家～，步她人真的超级温柔的哦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"a99d7b03cb60f562af0eb3bf3bb7853d73d6aa4e4c8a1563380c0aba330360b9","ja":"あー、やっぱだめ！　これ以上、みんなの見てる前で\n褒められるなんてハズすぎるって！","zh":"啊——果然还是不行！要是再这样当着大家的面\n被夸奖下去，也太难为情了吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"fee8dab5323e7cca021f7a3281f2a4079e581fac651fb22d1a39b70df60f15c6","ja":"翼、アタシのことはもういいから、\n他の子のいいところを……。","zh":"翼，你就别管我了，\n多说说其他人的优点吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"361a9ce9d4d9f89af81985daf944ecb7583ba80b0e420ed52174b83bbca15522","ja":"わあ♪　「歩ちゃんの優しさは世界一！」\nってコメントがたくさん来てるよー！","zh":"哇♪　有好多评论说\n“小步的温柔是世界第一！”哦——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"47dba834507d458dd1fa65141acfc8d63f0301cc5fe29db20d5532d3fee07a1a","ja":"他にも、「改めて歩さんのファンになります」\nだそうですよ！","zh":"另外，还有人说\n“我要重新成为步的粉丝”哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"e06fff0ce59a5119151dabd7eb1c8134eb8b6d59d328a5dc93dad673f5e5c835","ja":"やったぁ！　狙いバッチリ！\nそれじゃあ次は、誰に聞こうかな～♪","zh":"太棒啦！完全正中目标！\n那么接下来，该去问谁好呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1324.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"d79e3d5201bbaaa4a08103d0466a98ddb65fb15fdee9976cf8870f9a3114c89f","ja":"ちょっと、みんな手をあげないで！\nアタシのこと話すの、ストーップ！！","zh":"等一下，大家别举手！\n不许再聊我的事了，停——下！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
